<article class="ltx_document ltx_authors_1line">
<h1 class="ltx_title ltx_title_document"><span id="id1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter ltx_font_bold">D-REX</span>: A Benchmark for Detecting Deceptive 
<br class="ltx_break">Reasoning in Large Language Models</h1>
<div class="ltx_authors">
